      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        "NPC",
        "national product catalog"
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Adopting a suitable technology tool supports the ongoing management of product master data while maintaining consistent quality and compliance with defined standards. A widely used term for such a tool is the NPC, which many countries implement to oversee product master data."
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Handbook wording, quoted. A candidate: not adopted, nothing chosen between alternatives. The handbook names the TOOL the NPC; it realises the Product Registry foundational component of the dth-sc DHSC architecture (page 16). Link target in smart-ra: Product Catalog Management System / Product Registry.",
